{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>בצאנם</b> — He returned to Judah alone, for the Temple is in their inheritance." "<b>חלץ</b> — His glory from them, as it says, אלכה ואשובה אל מקומי (\"I will go and return to My place\"). And why did He withdraw from them? Because they betrayed YHWH."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:14.951205436Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}